import LOEIS.A144.A144160.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A144160

Number of pairs p,q with p < q such that 30*r(n)=p+q+2 and p p+2, q q+2 twin primes, r(i)=i-th prime.

The 80 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A144160

